WEBVTT

00:15:59.812 --> 00:16:02.789
They are real Olympic
champions of mind training.

00:16:02.813 --> 00:16:04.314
(Laughter)

00:16:05.814 --> 00:16:09.658
This is the place where the meditators --
you can see it's kind of inspiring.

00:16:09.682 --> 00:16:13.369
Now, here with 256 electrodes.

00:16:15.817 --> 00:16:18.509
(Laughter)

00:16:18.896 --> 00:16:20.077
So what did they find?

00:16:20.101 --> 00:16:22.976
Of course, same thing.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.697
The scientific embargo --

00:16:24.721 --> 00:16:28.895
a paper has been submitted to "Nature,"
hopefully, it will be accepted.

00:16:29.246 --> 00:16:33.237
It deals with the state of compassion,
unconditional compassion.